      "id": "epochs",
      "title": "Turns of the feedback loop (epochs), on the default field",
      "description": "Money follows earnings (half of each round's money by recent earnings) and the shares are reset E times in the run's 120 rounds: once (the loop never turns), 5 times, 20 times, or every round. Equal money (f = 0) is the control. Total money 250 (the default 1200 leaves every sharing setup at the ceiling). Same field, agents and total money in every row; each seed gives the same field and agents.",
      "question": "Does OSO's lead grow with more turns of the feedback loop?",
      "compare": "traditional, shared library, OSO α 0.8 and α 0.2 (rules decide sharing), and agents choosing at α 1 and α 0.2, by how often money follows earnings",
